From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Phil Reif <pr@sambal.net>
Date: Sat, 17 Oct 2026 13:38:50 +0200
Subject: [PATCH] feat(frontend): dice tray in the composer with a results card

A floating dice bar at the composer lets the viewer pick d4 to d100, a
modifier, and in Daggerheart advantage or disadvantage, or in Savage
Worlds the Wild Die (on for players, off in GM mode) and damage rolls.
The bar shows the resulting !r command for the dice bot. Send puts it into
an empty composer and sends it, or posts it directly when the composer has
other text. The bar then shows the bot's answer for the viewer's latest
roll command, typed or clicked: the total, the Daggerheart outcome
(Hope, Fear, critical) or the Savage Worlds outcome (success, raises,
failure), and the dice in the colours of the 3D dice. The composer's dice
button hides or shows the bar per room. A card above the room composer
shows the latest results while the bar is hidden, the latest result per
player for a GM.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
